  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-16T13:11:23.167936Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-19T01:46:01.103882Z",
  "totalBlocks": 139,
  "translatedBlocks": 138,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8550a5bf312caab5",
      "translationZh": "🚀 引言",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43dd5a29b7eee51d",
      "translationZh": "TRL 支持使用 GRPO 训练 LLM，GRPO 是 DeepSeekMath 论文近期提出的一种在线学习算法。在 GRPO 中，模型从自身的输出中学习：它在训练期间生成回答、接收反馈，并利用这些反馈不断改进自身。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47d1058083c605c2",
      "translationZh": "这使得生成成为训练循环中的关键步骤，同时也是一个主要瓶颈。为了加快生成速度，TRL 集成了 vLLM。这一组合让你能够在 GRPO 配置下更高效地训练强大的模型。不过，这里有个问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2427c867d29afefa",
      "translationZh": "🧨 问题所在",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72c144a2418de8d5",
      "translationZh": "在 TRL v0.18.0 之前，vLLM 仅支持服务器模式，即作为独立进程运行，使用与训练任务不同的 GPU。它通过 HTTP 与训练脚本通信，这使得整个配置具有模块化、易于使用的特点，但也带来了 GPU 利用效率低下的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e48fd5ccfcee2cef",
      "translationZh": "具体情况如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c10d8714023a48f",
      "translationZh": "在训练期间，模型需要频繁生成补全文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c79aa66aa7cacfd",
      "translationZh": "训练器向 vLLM 服务器发送请求，而该服务器运行在其专用的 GPU 上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "72fcd4182d790fab",
      "translationZh": "当 vLLM 进行生成时，训练用的 GPU 处于空闲状态，只能等待。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "41014ad270e713c6",
      "translationZh": "一旦生成完成，vLLM 使用的 GPU 就会闲置，而训练则恢复进行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0a8bcc0fb787960",
      "translationZh": "训练与生成之间的这种“乒乓式”交替会导致：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9595a07b91541712",
      "translationZh": "双方的 GPU 时间都被浪费",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e7cc7505343064a4",
      "translationZh": "仅仅为了运行推理，就需要更多额外的 GPU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e91876c70909d8e",
      "translationZh": "整体吞吐量降低，成本升高",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5013afd3dad90415",
      "translationZh": "在 GRPO 这类需要持续进行生成的在线学习方法中，这种低效带来的问题更加令人头疼。你在硬件上花了更多钱，却得不到预期的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a9a6afb7d54cad2",
      "translationZh": "因此，关键问题变成了：我们能否让训练和生成共用同一批 GPU，而不是将它们分开？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b9633dc058154b6d",
      "translationZh": "💡 契机",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "426ba20533d7f7c9",
      "translationZh": "主要问题在于，训练和推理分别在不同的 GPU 上运行，导致设备空闲、利用率不足。顺理成章的解决办法是什么？让两者在同一批 GPU 上运行。如果不再让 vLLM 作为独立服务器，在自己的进程和设备上运行，而是让它与训练代码一起，在同一个分布式进程组内运行，会怎么样？这样，我们就能启动一个分布式作业，让训练和推理共享同一批设备，在任务之间高效切换，而不浪费资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e4e57a2cc085533",
      "translationZh": "这种方法就是我们所说的共置（colocation）。训练和推理被部署在同一批 GPU 上，并通过同一个进程组进行协调，从而能够顺畅地交替运行，无需额外硬件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddfe8bc34cf0093f",
      "translationZh": "此前，TRL 依赖作为外部 HTTP 服务器运行的 vLLM，因此无法实现这一点。我们的 PR #3394 改变了这一局面，增加了对 vLLM 外部启动器的支持，使其真正集成到训练进程中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3f109d107492d315",
      "translationZh": "它能带来什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9a7bc782d95952a",
      "translationZh": "统一执行：通过将 vLLM 嵌入同一个进程组，训练和推理任务可以共享同一批 GPU，交替运行，而不是相互等待。这减少了空闲时间，并提高了整体效率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20b0fe36bdde070e",
      "translationZh": "省去 HTTP 通信：无需 REST API 调用或网络通信——vLLM 直接在训练循环中运行，避免了开销和延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "649695733b13a0a0",
      "translationZh": "Torchrun 兼容性：与 torchrun 无缝配合，只需极少的配置更改，即可轻松扩展到多个节点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "618cb264d964d6c7",
      "translationZh": "支持 TP 和 DP：兼容张量并行和数据并行，适用于大规模训练任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89f7297f9bc17ad5",
      "translationZh": "SPMD 执行模式：采用单程序多数据（SPMD）模型，每个 GPU 同步运行各自的引擎实例。非常适合分布式多 GPU、多节点部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e876a8faa36bcbbf",
      "translationZh": "简化部署：你不再需要维护单独的服务器脚本——vLLM 直接在训练作业内启动和控制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43f51564be6a5c21",
      "translationZh": "提升吞吐量：通过避免 GPU 闲置并消除进程间通信，系统能够加快训练和生成速度，这对于 GRPO 等在线学习场景尤为重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e93482ad45916d75",
      "translationZh": "更稳健的进程间通信：这种方式更加稳健，因为它避免了服务器模式所需的、在独立进程之间建立分布式进程组的复杂性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "224a2ff234cc231e",
      "translationZh": "得益于这一功能，训练与推理的共置运行不再是一种临时变通方案——如今，它已获得一等支持，具备可扩展性，并可用于生产环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d3be4d812ab56885",
      "translationZh": "🧩 设计：从独立服务器到共享 GPU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52bbd903d7c6abe0",
      "translationZh": "从服务器模式 TRL 转向共置模式 TRL，核心在于更智能地利用 GPU。下图展示了两者的区别：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3170f12ee1c39015",
      "translationZh": "服务器模式下的 TRL 配置（顶行）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e1d6158ac524f4b",
      "translationZh": "在服务器模式下的 TRL 配置中，训练和推理在不同的 GPU 上运行。例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "30bc73e6e0dedf3c",
      "translationZh": "GPU 0 至 2 用于训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a08439dd296c80e",
      "translationZh": "GPU 3 完全专用于运行作为独立服务器的 vLLM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7db966df802cac25",
      "translationZh": "在训练步骤期间，GPU 3 处于空闲状态。在生成步骤（推理）期间，GPU 0–2 处于空闲状态，而 GPU 3 则生成输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73df2593c9b5d059",
      "translationZh": "这会导致：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f10f0a02b6091f6",
      "translationZh": "GPU 利用效率低下，设备频繁相互等待",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ff20309dec8d107b",
      "translationZh": "需要额外配置仅用于推理的 GPU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7cb2f843c59b05b6",
      "translationZh": "增加成本和复杂性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "83680f2b24465bed",
      "translationZh": "同卡部署的 TRL 配置（下排）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c59b436884bf5f38",
      "translationZh": "相比之下，同卡部署的 TRL 配置在同一组 GPU 上运行训练和 vLLM。每个 GPU：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "07fbab5a35a90553",
      "translationZh": "运行训练循环",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "067819cc83bedd2e",
      "translationZh": "在同一进程内启动一个 vLLM 引擎",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "627a3d2225018666",
      "translationZh": "训练和推理轮流使用 GPU 的资源——无需专用设备或独立进程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99ea3d8639c3a97e",
      "translationZh": "这种设计：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ca1c10c5f56e50af",
      "translationZh": "减少空闲时间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "31e1de863a89f0a2",
      "translationZh": "最大限度地减少进程间通信和 HTTP 通信",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f705fcbac113bb9c",
      "translationZh": "充分利用可用的 GPU 显存和算力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "097c1dcb619d2e94",
      "translationZh": "在不增加硬件需求的情况下提供更高的吞吐量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "72c84db59746df0c",
      "translationZh": "🛠️ 实现说明",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10e2683ab39d261a",
      "translationZh": "训练器现在不再将 vLLM 作为服务器启动，而是使用外部启动器在进程内启动 vLLM，如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19395077b9aaf1d1",
      "translationZh": "共置的 vLLM 遵循 torch.distributed 的进程组和 rank 结构。这使得 vLLM 能够与训练一同初始化而不发生冲突，并使 TP/DP 配置无缝运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6f94d87126c453b",
      "translationZh": "共置的 vLLM 不再依赖 REST APIs——它直接在内存中运行，并通过原生 Python 调用进行通信：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f27ce110e8953dc4",
      "translationZh": "要使用此配置，只需在 GRPO 配置中设置 vllm_mode=\"colocate\"：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "511d8a40e270aa4a",
      "translationZh": "注意：根据模型大小和训练所需的总体 GPU 显存，你可能需要调整 GRPOConfig 中的 vllm_gpu_memory_utilization 参数，以避免显存利用不足或显存不足错误。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "341e163ec0af7f4a",
      "translationZh": "📊 效果展示：共置模式与常规 TRL 的性能对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8635978414294710",
      "translationZh": "为了衡量共置的影响，我们进行了一系列实验，对比传统的服务器模式（vLLM 在单独的 GPU 上作为独立服务器运行）与新的共置模式（训练和推理共享相同的 GPU）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7745386b9880718",
      "translationZh": "在服务器模式下，只有 7 块 GPU 用于训练，因为有 1 块 GPU 完全专用于 vLLM 推理服务器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "462fd487d975a235",
      "translationZh": "在共置模式下，全部 8 块 GPU 都用于训练——默认情况下，这会增大有效批次大小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3c0b2187a3c1a04",
      "translationZh": "为确保公平比较，我们将服务器模式的吞吐量乘以 8/7 进行归一化。这一调整考虑了共置模式更强的训练能力，使我们能够在相同的训练条件下比较这两种配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b546167b39524f3f",
      "translationZh": "实验 1：1.5B 模型——不同批次大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b032fd520390bda1",
      "translationZh": "随着批次大小增加，两种配置的吞吐量都有所提升。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3b9fad1032512329",
      "translationZh": "在最大的批量大小下，共置部署的加速比最高达到 1.43×。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c20677388d717163",
      "translationZh": "在共置模式下，更大的批量能更充分地利用共享 GPU 显存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4a91338c18b1e5d3",
      "translationZh": "实验 2：1.5B 模型——改变张量并行度（TP）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "322cec04803cefc0",
      "translationZh": "在共置部署中，提高 TP 会降低性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0364f6ff9cd6ba10",
      "translationZh": "更多分片会引入更多通信开销——这对于较小的模型并不理想。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d0d9623d96a3a5fb",
      "translationZh": "要点：对于小模型，应避免在共置模式下过度分片。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "026c420e74ce7a4c",
      "translationZh": "实验 3：7B 模型——改变批量大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a4e2d9e86bbc3657",
      "translationZh": "同样，随着批量大小增加，共置模式表现出更好的扩展性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9c5fd25a986dd99",
      "translationZh": "在测试的最大批次下，加速比达到 1.35×。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c5cfaef38a9cdc1c",
      "translationZh": "实验 4：7B 模型——改变张量并行度（TP）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3cad020e9160137",
      "translationZh": "趋势与 1.5B 模型相反。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8bc81b3c45215a46",
      "translationZh": "对于 7B 模型，提高 TP 可提升吞吐量，加速比最高达到 1.73×。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f74b89e72915c049",
      "translationZh": "在共置部署中，较大的模型可从分片中获益。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b63c703166194573",
      "translationZh": "📊 扩展至 72B 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff269fc92c4f9fb0",
      "translationZh": "训练 Qwen2.5-Math-72B 这样的大模型时，采用合适的策略至关重要，这样才能让训练在多个 GPU 和节点上保持高效、可扩展且稳定。在我们的配置中，我们将共置部署的 vLLM 与几项关键优化相结合，以高效实现这一目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "14269460b5e05616",
      "translationZh": "vLLM 中的睡眠模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d594b1d33cd473c4",
      "translationZh": "使用共置训练时，GPU 内存管理至关重要，这样才能让训练和推理在同一组设备上顺畅运行。为此，我们将 vLLM 的 sleep() API 加入了 GRPO 训练循环。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "989b6711c8e5e3ae",
      "translationZh": "sleep() 函数会暂时暂停 vLLM 引擎并释放 GPU 内存。它支持两个级别：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "735c0bf579f2f18c",
      "translationZh": "级别 1：将模型权重从 GPU 卸载（保留在 CPU 内存中），并清空 KV 缓存。适用于很快就会再次使用同一模型的情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c8a1cb4ec0f0660",
      "translationZh": "级别 2：完全卸载模型权重和 KV 缓存。最适合模型将发生变化或不会立即再次使用的场景。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1dc2f5e2bffb765",
      "translationZh": "在 GRPO 中，每一步之后都会更新模型，因此我们使用级别 2 休眠。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "01ad3b56ffd1c618",
      "translationZh": "级别 2 休眠的优势：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ff72f57bf9f696a8",
      "translationZh": "最大限度地增加可供训练使用的空闲 GPU 内存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fde994f680e37147",
      "translationZh": "避免训练与生成之间的内存争用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b66cf6bb5c549126",
      "translationZh": "即使对于 Qwen2.5-72B 这样的大型模型，也能保持高效的共置部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b3a8f2c5fb7c1bd",
      "translationZh": "这一小小的补充，对于实现流畅且可扩展的共置训练起到了重要作用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4354c9f4b521b321",
      "translationZh": "DeepSpeed 优化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce6c36365344bae7",
      "translationZh": "为了训练 Qwen2.5-72B 这样的大型模型，我们依赖 DeepSpeed ZeRO Stage 3，这与原生 TRL 中使用的配置相同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a7a36e81f1390fd",
      "translationZh": "ZeRO 通过将内存占用分散到多个 GPU 上，帮助大型模型扩展规模。Stage 3 则更进一步，对以下内容进行分片：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f8c9dd3544fb3592",
      "translationZh": "模型权重",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ab64614fdfe4f15b",
      "translationZh": "梯度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b19aa999df68afda",
      "translationZh": "优化器状态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae1f490e418d308e",
      "translationZh": "对于无法放入单个 GPU 的模型，这一点至关重要。使用 ZeRO Stage 3 时，每个 GPU 仅负责模型的一部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f0c78e25fc5c060",
      "translationZh": "我们还启用了以下选项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a71ee977aba0a885",
      "translationZh": "\"offload_optimizer\": {\"device\": \"cpu\"} 将优化器状态转移到 CPU，以释放 GPU 显存——这在共置部署场景中至关重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f74b7b3fa514dd2e",
      "translationZh": "\"overlap_comm\": true 使通信与计算重叠进行，从而加快训练速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6825d643a12c55f",
      "translationZh": "\"contiguous_gradients\": true 在单个内存块中分配梯度，从而改善内存访问并减少碎片化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b81c6fc6b45890ae",
      "translationZh": "这些优化有助于高效训练 72B 模型，并确保共置部署在显存限制严苛的情况下仍保持稳定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d463257d99001866",
      "translationZh": "Accelerate 集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46541d885e57421f",
      "translationZh": "按照 TRL 的建议，我们使用 Accelerate，这是一个可简化分布式训练的轻量级库。它负责处理：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "863796621d52eff3",
      "translationZh": "多 GPU 和多节点作业启动",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8bbb1577639f3853",
      "translationZh": "数据并行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "24cafc994d02acb4",
      "translationZh": "梯度累积",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3b9bae106b07d77",
      "translationZh": "分布式数据加载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c90c9368c1e99768",
      "translationZh": "这使得该配置简洁、可扩展且易于维护。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "79e5096f43b7bc92",
      "translationZh": "实验 5：Qwen2.5-Math-72B——吞吐量、准确率与基准测试结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "960bcc4e48b929b8",
      "translationZh": "吞吐量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4efd742235390f64",
      "translationZh": "即使少用 4 个 GPU，协同部署配置的速度仍约为普通 TRL 的 1.26 倍。这凸显了更智能的 GPU 共享以及使用 sleep() 清理内存的有效性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "60a431c45ea7cc92",
      "translationZh": "奖励曲线",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "560a142f51a67c8e",
      "translationZh": "共置配置与普通配置的训练奖励曲线几乎完全一致，这表明：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc781524d5d942aa",
      "translationZh": "共置训练保持了准确性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "20e4515287459604",
      "translationZh": "模型的学习性能没有退化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8959b91e245bdba1",
      "translationZh": "Math500 基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "243af6f34679ad82",
      "translationZh": "我们在 Math500 基准上评估了三个模型：基础模型、共置训练模型和普通训练模型。两个经过训练的模型都优于基础模型，而共置训练模型的表现与普通训练模型相当——这证实了共置不会损害下游性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "168172e427e54e91",
      "translationZh": "🎓 挑战、经验教训与后续步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbb000be121968b5",
      "translationZh": "在利用共置的 vLLM 扩展 GRPO 训练规模的过程中，我们遇到了若干关键挑战，并在大模型训练的效率、灵活性和系统设计方面积累了重要的经验教训。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "40b9c8f444870eff",
      "translationZh": "挑战",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71c0c08892a88510",
      "translationZh": "vLLM ≥ 0.8.0 中的张量并行缺陷。在 vLLM 0.8.0 及更高版本中，配合 external_launcher 使用的张量并行（TP）不再正常工作。该问题在 Issue #15895 中进行了跟踪。为了找出引入问题的位置，我们采用了这篇 vLLM 开发者博客文章中介绍的方法，该方法为每次提交都提供了 wheel 包。经过二分查找，我们确定引入问题的提交是 cc10281。根本原因在于确定性——较新的版本要求显式设置随机种子。设置种子后，问题就消失了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9eaf7f89f61bb1c0",
      "translationZh": "2 级休眠缓冲区缺陷。最初，当我们尝试使用 load_weights 重新加载权重时，2 级休眠无法正常工作。该问题在 Issue #16564 中进行了跟踪。问题在于，从休眠中唤醒后，模型缓冲区（例如 BatchNorm 中的运行均值/方差）没有得到恢复。PR #16889 修复了这一问题，增加了从 2 级休眠中唤醒时显式恢复缓冲区的逻辑。现在，我们会保留原始缓冲区的副本，并在加载新权重后手动重新应用它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e636ecc5f1cb529",
      "translationZh": "退出时发生段错误。vLLM 休眠仍有一个尚未解决的问题：在训练结束、关闭进程时会导致段错误。该问题已在 Issue #16993 中报告。这种崩溃发生在关闭过程中，但不会影响训练本身，因此我们得以完成本篇博客中分享的所有演示和实验。不过，在将 sleep() 完全集成到 TRL 上游之前，我们还在等待官方修复。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "973e9538cb32f53d",
      "translationZh": "这些挑战并未构成阻碍，但需要仔细调试、做好版本控制，并更深入地理解 vLLM 在底层如何管理内存和并行机制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4934e796c1f90b97",
      "translationZh": "经验总结",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1bd0215adc8efede",
      "translationZh": "共置推理显著提高了 GPU 利用率。通过让训练和生成共享同一组 GPU，我们消除了空闲时间，降低了硬件需求——即使使用更少的 GPU，也能实现更高的吞吐量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de95605a39d7aaa3",
      "translationZh": "vLLM 的 sleep() 功能对于大规模共置至关重要。它能够对内存使用进行细粒度控制，使训练能够在生成步骤之间完全回收 GPU 显存——这是支持 Qwen2.5-72B 等模型的关键条件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0129",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d510c118d19f1338",
      "translationZh": "DeepSpeed ZeRO Stage 3 对训练大型模型至关重要。它将模型权重、梯度和优化器状态分布到多个 GPU 上，使超大规模网络能够装入内存。根据我们的经验，启用 contiguous_gradients 有助于减少内存碎片，而将优化器卸载到 CPU 则释放了关键的 GPU 显存——这两点在共置配置中尤其有帮助。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d58c7bc2d23833f",
      "translationZh": "共置功能强大，但也需要权衡。它在 GPU 显存得到精细管理时效果最佳，通常需要手动调整 vllm_gpu_memory_utilization 等内存使用参数。虽然共置能显著提升吞吐量并减少 GPU 空闲时间，但对于显存预算紧张的模型，或内存碎片未得到良好控制的情况，共置可能并不理想。不过，只要配置得当，它就能带来显著的效率提升。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3053a367edd84012",
      "translationZh": "TP/DP 兼容性以及对 Accelerate 和 torchrun 的支持，使部署变得顺畅。尽管底层架构复杂，整个系统仍可使用标准分布式工具启动和扩展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d730d0682aadd533",
      "translationZh": "共置训练能够保持模型质量。在多个基准测试（Math500、AIME24）中，共置配置与常规配置取得了相当的结果，验证了效率的提升并未以牺牲模型表现为代价。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "19074c241348a8f7",
      "translationZh": "✅ 结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f476c658ebea3ab2",
      "translationZh": "这篇博客文章探讨了如何通过将 vLLM 与 GRPO 训练共置，在训练大语言模型时实现显著的效率提升——包括规模大至 Qwen2.5-72B 的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3601c31fba21e80",
      "translationZh": "以往，TRL 仅支持以服务器模式运行 vLLM，这需要使用独立的进程和 GPU 进行推理，从而造成算力浪费和空闲等待。随着 vLLM 的外部启动器以及 TRL PR #3394 中共置功能的引入，我们现在可以在同一个分布式进程组内、同一组 GPU 上运行训练和推理，并全面支持 TP、DP 和 Accelerate。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbc95c83e597b7e1",
      "translationZh": "尽管仍存在一些挑战——例如特定版本的 vLLM 错误，以及与 sleep() 等相关的边界情况——但总体结果表明，共置式 GRPO 是一种实用、可扩展的解决方案，能够高效训练大型模型。我们满怀期待，将继续完善这一配置，集成 FSDP 等功能，并突破大型模型训练的极限——让所有构建下一代 LLM 的人都能以更快、更低成本、更易于使用的方式开展训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "28472fa28bf050dd",
      "translationZh": "✅ 试一试！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0138",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b099d470653f652a",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个示例，可用于尝试使用同机部署的 vLLM 进行 GRPO 训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
